									<p class="text-base-content/60 text-xs">
										{
											isEn
												? 'Binding deadlines and withdrawal management'
												: 'Scadenze vincolanti e gestione delle rinunce'
										}
									</p>
								</div>
							</div>

							<ul class="space-y-3 text-sm leading-relaxed">
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
									<CircleCheck class="text-warning mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0" />
									<span>
										{
											isEn ? (
												<>
													<strong>Mandatory AISF membership:</strong> anyone not yet enrolled at the
													time of selection must join by paying the <strong>membership fee</strong>,
													in addition to the CISF27 registration fee.
												</>
											) : (
												<>
													<strong>Iscrizione ad AISF obbligatoria:</strong> chi non è iscrittə al
													momento della selezione ha l'obbligo di iscriversi pagando il{' '}
													<strong>contributo associativo</strong>, da aggiungersi alla quota CISF27.
												</>
											)
										}
									</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
									<CircleCheck class="text-warning mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0" />
									<span>
										{
											isEn ? (
												<>
													<strong>Payment within 7 days (1 week):</strong> selected participants
													must complete payment no later than one week after notification from the
													OC.
												</>
											) : (
												<>
													<strong>Pagamento entro 7 giorni (1 settimana):</strong> le persone
													selezionate devono completare il pagamento entro e non oltre una settimana
													dalla comunicazione del CO.
												</>
											)
										}
									</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
									<CircleCheck class="text-warning mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0" />
									<span>
										{
											isEn ? (
												<>
													<strong>A single official waiting-list round:</strong> in case of missed
													payment, <strong>ONE SINGLE official waiting-list round</strong> will
													follow in the subsequent days (any extraordinary rounds will be announced
													on official channels but are not guaranteed).
												</>
											) : (
												<>
													<strong>Un solo ripescaggio ufficiale:</strong> in caso di mancato
													pagamento, seguirà <strong>UN SOLO ripescaggio ufficiale</strong> nei
													giorni successivi (eventuali ripescaggi straordinari saranno comunicati
													sui canali ufficiali ma non sono garantiti).
												</>
											)
										}
									</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
									<TriangleAlert class="text-error mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0" />
									<span>
										{
											isEn ? (
												<>
													<strong>Refund policy:</strong> once paid, the registration (or
													membership) fee is {/* prettier-ignore */}
													<span><strong>non-refundable under any circumstances</strong>.</span>{' '}
													However, the OC offers to <strong>act as an intermediary</strong> between
													withdrawing participants and those admitted from the waiting list.
												</>
											) : (
												<>
													<strong>Politica rimborsi:</strong> la quota di iscrizione (o
													associativa), una volta versata,{' '}
													<strong>non è in nessun modo rimborsabile</strong>. Ad ogni modo, il CO si
													offre di <strong>fungere da intermediario</strong> tra rinunciatarə e
													ripescatə.
												</>
											)
										}
									</span>
								</li>
							</ul>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Avvertenze, Garanzie EC & Accessibilità -->
					<div class="card card-border border-success/35 bg-base-100 card-interactive">
						<div class="card-body p-6 sm:p-7">
							<div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
								<div
									class="from-success/20 to-info/20 flex size-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-linear-to-br"
								>
									<Info class="text-success size-6" />
								</div>
								<div>
									<h3 class="card-title text-xl">
										{
											isEn
												? 'Guarantees, Accessibility & Notices'
												: 'Garanzie, Accessibilità & Avvertenze'
										}
									</h3>
									<p class="text-base-content/60 text-xs">
										{
											isEn
												? 'National oversight and protection of all personal needs'
												: 'Supervisione nazionale e tutela di tutte le esigenze personali'
										}
									</p>
								</div>
							</div>

							<div class="space-y-3 text-sm leading-relaxed">
								<div class="bg-success/8 border-success/25 rounded-xl border p-3.5">
									<p class="text-success mb-1 font-bold">
										{
											isEn
												? 'Allergies, dietary needs, and accessibility'
												: 'Allergie, esigenze alimentari e accessibilità'
										}
									</p>
									<p class="text-base-content/80 text-xs leading-relaxed sm:text-sm">
										{
											isEn ? (
												<>
													We encourage you to indicate allergies, intolerances, dietary preferences,
													and any physical or logistical needs in your application to make CISF27
													fully inclusive and accessible.{' '}
													<strong>In no way do such disclosures affect selection.</strong>
												</>
											) : (
												<>
													Ti invitiamo a indicare nella candidatura allergie, intolleranze,
													preferenze alimentari e qualsiasi necessità fisica o logistica per rendere
													CISF27 pienamente inclusiva e accessibile.{' '}
													<strong>
														In nessun modo tali segnalazioni influiscono sulla selezione.
													</strong>
												</>
											)
										}
									</p>
								</div>

								<p class="text-base-content/75">
									{
										isEn ? (
											<>
												<strong>Executive Committee oversight:</strong> to guarantee the selection
												process, you can always request further information on the criteria from the
												OC {/* prettier-ignore */}
												<span>(<a href="mailto:cisf27@ai-sf.it" class="link link-primary font-medium">cisf27@ai-sf.it</a>)</span>{' '}
												and the AISF Executive Committee (EC), which oversees every step.
											</>
										) : (
											<>
												<strong>Supervisione del Comitato Esecutivo:</strong> a garanzia del
												processo di selezione, è sempre possibile richiedere ulteriori informazioni
												sui criteri al CO {/* prettier-ignore */}
												<span>(<a href="mailto:cisf27@ai-sf.it" class="link link-primary font-medium">cisf27@ai-sf.it</a>)</span>{' '}
												e al Comitato Esecutivo (EC) AISF, che supervisiona ogni passo.
											</>
										)
									}
								</p>

								<p class="text-base-content/70 text-xs sm:text-sm">
									{
										isEn ? (
											<>
												<strong>Safeguard clause:</strong> the OC reserves the right to make
												technical or organisational adjustments if needed, while strictly adhering
												to the declared criteria.
											</>
										) : (
											<>
												<strong>Clausola di salvaguardia:</strong> il CO si riserva la facoltà di
												effettuare eventuali aggiustamenti tecnici o organizzativi, pur attenendosi
												con rigore ai criteri dichiarati.
											</>
										)
									}
								</p>
							</div>

							<div class="mt-5 pt-2">
								<a
									href={criteriPdfUrl}
									target="_blank"
									rel="noopener noreferrer"
									class="btn btn-primary btn-outline btn-sm sm:btn-md w-full gap-2 sm:w-auto"
								>
									<Download class="size-4 shrink-0" />
									<span>
										{
											isEn
												? 'Download Full Selection Criteria PDF (IT)'
												: 'Scarica il PDF Integrale dei Criteri'
										}
									</span>
								</a>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- =================================================================== -->
	<!-- SEZIONE 2: IL CODICE ETICO DI CISF27 BOLOGNA                        -->
	<!-- =================================================================== -->
	<section id="codice-etico" class="reveal bg-base-100 py-20 lg:py-24">
		<div class="container mx-auto px-4 lg:px-8">
			<div class="mx-auto mb-12 max-w-3xl text-center">
				<SectionBadge
					icon={ShieldCheck}
					label={isEn ? 'Section 2 · Principles & Values' : 'Sezione 2 · Principi & Valori'}
					badgeClass="badge-secondary"
				/>
				<h2 class="mb-4 text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl">
					{
						isEn ? (
							<>
								The Code of Ethics of{' '}
								<GradientSpan gradient="from-secondary to-primary">CISF27 Bologna</GradientSpan>
							</>
						) : (
							<>
								Il Codice Etico di{' '}
								<GradientSpan gradient="from-secondary to-primary">CISF27 Bologna</GradientSpan>
							</>
						)
					}
				</h2>
				<p class="text-base-content/70 mb-7 text-base leading-relaxed sm:text-lg">
					{
						isEn ? (
							<>
								The real principles resolved and adopted by the Organising Committee — in alignment
								with the <strong>AISF APS Statute</strong>, the {/* prettier-ignore */}
								<span><strong>AISF Strategic Plan</strong>,</span> and the {/* prettier-ignore */}
								<span><strong>IAPS <em>Code of Conduct</em></strong></span> — binding on
								participants, OC, speakers, guests, sponsors, and suppliers.
							</>
						) : (
							<>
								I principi reali deliberati e adottati dal Comitato Organizzatore — in coerenza con
								lo <strong>Statuto APS di AISF</strong>, il <strong>Piano Strategico AISF</strong> e
								il{' '}
								<strong>
									<em>Code of Conduct</em> di IAPS
								</strong>{' '}
								— vincolanti per partecipanti, CO, relatori, ospiti, sponsor e fornitori.
							</>
						)
					}
				</p>
				<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3">
					<a
						href={codiceEticoPdfUrl}
						target="_blank"
						rel="noopener noreferrer"
						class="btn btn-secondary btn-md sm:btn-lg shadow-secondary/20 hover:shadow-secondary/35 card-interactive gap-2 shadow-lg"
					>
						<Download class="size-5 shrink-0" />
						<span>
							{
								isEn
									? 'Download Official Code of Ethics PDF (IT)'
									: 'Scarica il PDF del Codice Etico Ufficiale'
							}
						</span>
					</a>
					<a href="#contatti-riservati" class="btn btn-ghost btn-md sm:btn-lg gap-2">
						<Lock class="text-secondary size-4 shrink-0" />
						<span>
							{isEn ? 'Confidential Reporting Channels' : 'Canali di Segnalazione Riservati'}
						</span>
					</a>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- 6 Ethical Pillars Grid -->
			<div class="reveal-stagger mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
				{
					ethicsPillars.map((pillar) => {
						const Icon = pillar.icon;
						return (
							<article
								class:list={[
									'card card-border bg-base-200/40 card-interactive flex flex-col',
									pillar.borderColor,
								]}
							>
								<div class="card-body flex flex-1 flex-col p-6">
									<div class="mb-4 flex items-start justify-between gap-3">
										<div
											class:list={[
												'flex size-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-linear-to-br',
												pillar.accentBg,
											]}
										>
											<Icon class:list={['size-6', pillar.iconColor]} />
										</div>
										<span class:list={['badge badge-sm font-semibold', pillar.badgeClass]}>
											{pillar.badge}
										</span>
									</div>

									<h3 class="card-title mb-2 text-xl leading-snug">{pillar.title}</h3>
									<p class="text-base-content/75 mb-4 text-sm leading-relaxed">
										{pillar.description}
									</p>

									{pillar.hasPlasticFreeLogo && (
										<div class="bg-base-100 border-success/25 mb-4 flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border p-3">
											<Image
												src={plasticFreerLogo}
												alt={
													isEn
														? 'Emilia-Romagna Regional #Plastic-freER Strategy Logo'
														: 'Logo Strategia Regionale #Plastic-freER Emilia-Romagna'
												}
												class="h-11 w-auto shrink-0 object-contain"
											/>
											<p class="text-base-content/70 text-xs leading-snug">
												{isEn
													? 'Official adherence to the regional strategy for reducing plastics in the environment.'
													: "Adesione ufficiale alla strategia regionale per la riduzione delle plastiche sull'ambiente."}
											</p>
										</div>
									)}

									<ul class="border-base-300/70 mt-auto space-y-2 border-t pt-4 text-xs sm:text-sm">
										{pillar.points.map((point) => (
											<li class="text-base-content/80 flex items-start gap-2">
												<CircleCheck class:list={['mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0', pillar.iconColor]} />
												<span>{point}</span>
											</li>
										))}
									</ul>
								</div>
							</article>
						);
					})
				}
			</div>

			<!-- Box Contatti Riservati dei Coordinatori Generali -->
			<div id="contatti-riservati" class="mx-auto mt-14 max-w-5xl">
				<div
					class="card card-border border-secondary/35 from-secondary/10 via-base-100 to-primary/10 bg-linear-to-br shadow-md"
				>
					<div class="card-body p-6 sm:p-8 lg:p-10">
						<div class="mb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between">
							<div class="flex items-start gap-4">
								<div
									class="from-secondary to-primary text-primary-content flex size-14 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-linear-to-br shadow-md"
								>
									<Lock class="size-7" />
								</div>
								<div>
									<span class="badge badge-secondary badge-soft badge-sm mb-2 font-semibold">
										{
											isEn
												? 'Protected Listening & Zero Retaliation'
												: 'Ascolto Protetto & Zero Ritorsioni'
										}
									</span>
									<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold sm:text-3xl">
										{
											isEn
												? 'Confidential Channels of the General Coordinators'
												: 'Canali Riservati dei Coordinatori Generali'
										}
									</h3>
									<p
										class="text-base-content/75 mt-1 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-relaxed sm:text-base"
									>
										{
											isEn
												? 'Anyone who experiences, witnesses, or becomes aware of a violation of the Code of Ethics — during the application process, the Conference, or on digital channels — may write in strict confidence to the CISF27 General Coordinators.'
												: 'Chiunque subisca, osservi o venga a conoscenza di una violazione del Codice Etico — durante la candidatura, la Conferenza o sui canali digitali — può scrivere in via strettamente confidenziale ai Coordinatori Generali CISF27.'
										}
									</p>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">
							{
								confidentialContacts.map((coord) => (
									<div class="card card-border border-primary/25 bg-base-100/90 p-5 shadow-xs transition hover:shadow-md">
										<div class="flex items-center gap-4">
											<div class="from-primary/20 to-secondary/20 text-primary flex size-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-linear-to-br font-bold">
												{coord.initials}
											</div>
											<div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
												<p class="text-base font-bold sm:text-lg">{coord.name}</p>
												<p class="text-secondary text-xs font-medium sm:text-sm">{coord.role}</p>
												<a
													href={`mailto:${coord.email}`}
													class="link link-primary mt-1.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-semibold break-all"
												>
													<Mail class="size-4 shrink-0" />
													<span>{coord.email}</span>
												</a>
											</div>
										</div>
									</div>
								))
							}
						</div>

						<div
							class="border-base-300/70 text-base-content/70 mt-6 flex flex-col gap-3 border-t pt-5 text-xs leading-relaxed sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between sm:text-sm"
						>
							<p>
								{
									isEn ? (
										<>
											<strong>Guaranteed confidentiality:</strong> every report is handled with the
											utmost discretion and an absolute ban on retaliation. In case of a potential
											conflict of interest involving OC members, you can always contact the{' '}
											<strong>national AISF Executive Committee (EC)</strong> or the Board of
											Arbitrators (<em>Collegio dei Probiviri</em>, Art. 17 AISF Statute) directly.
										</>
									) : (
										<>
											<strong>Riservatezza garantita:</strong> ogni segnalazione viene presa in
											carico con massima discrezione e divieto assoluto di ritorsioni. In caso di
											potenziale conflitto di interesse che coinvolga membri del CO, è sempre
											possibile rivolgersi direttamente al{' '}
											<strong>Comitato Esecutivo (EC) nazionale di AISF</strong> o al Collegio dei
											Probiviri (Art. 17 Statuto AISF).
										</>
									)
								}
							</p>
							<a
								href="mailto:cisf27@ai-sf.it"
								class="btn btn-sm btn-outline btn-primary shrink-0 gap-1.5"
							>
								<Mail class="size-3.5" />
								<span>cisf27@ai-sf.it</span>
							</a>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- =================================================================== -->
	<!-- CTA FINALE                                                          -->
	<!-- =================================================================== -->
	<CTASection bgClass="from-primary/10 via-base-100 to-secondary/10">
		<Fragment slot="icon">
			<GraduationCap class="text-primary mx-auto mb-6 size-16" />
		</Fragment>
		<Fragment slot="heading">
			<h2 class="mb-5 text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl">
				{
					isEn ? (
						<>
							Ready to apply for <GradientSpan class="char-stagger">CISF27</GradientSpan>?
						</>
					) : (
						<>
							Prontə a candidarti a <GradientSpan class="char-stagger">CISF27</GradientSpan>?
						</>
					)
				}
			</h2>
		</Fragment>
		<Fragment slot="subtitle">
			<p class="text-base-content/70 mb-8 text-base leading-relaxed sm:text-lg">
				{
					isEn ? (
						<>
							Have you reviewed the public selection criteria and do you share the values of our
							Code of Ethics? Complete the application form or download the official documents to
							read them carefully.
							<span class="text-base-content/55 mt-2 block text-sm">
								Note: the application form and official PDFs are in Italian only, as a sufficient
								(at least passive) knowledge of Italian is required for the Conference.
							</span>
						</>
					) : (
						<>
							Hai consultato i criteri pubblici e condividi i valori del nostro Codice Etico?
							Compila il modulo di candidatura o scarica i documenti ufficiali per leggerli con
							calma.
						</>
					)
				}
			</p>
		</Fragment>
		<Fragment slot="actions">
			<a
				href={iscrizioneUrl}
				class="btn btn-primary btn-lg shadow-primary/25 hover:shadow-primary/40 card-interactive glow-hover gap-2 shadow-xl"
			>
				<NotebookPen class="size-5 shrink-0" />
				<span>{isEn ? 'Go to Application Form (IT)' : 'Vai al Modulo di Candidatura'}</span>
				<ArrowRight class="size-4 shrink-0" />
			</a>
			<a
				href={criteriPdfUrl}
				target="_blank"
				rel="noopener noreferrer"
				class="btn btn-outline btn-primary btn-lg card-interactive gap-2"
			>
				<Download class="size-5 shrink-0" />
				<span>{isEn ? 'Criteria PDF (IT)' : 'PDF Criteri'}</span>
			</a>
			<a
				href={codiceEticoPdfUrl}
				target="_blank"
				rel="noopener noreferrer"
				class="btn btn-outline btn-secondary btn-lg card-interactive gap-2"
			>
				<FileText class="size-5 shrink-0" />
				<span>{isEn ? 'Code of Ethics PDF (IT)' : 'PDF Codice Etico'}</span>
			</a>
			<a href={contactLink.href} class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg gap-1.5">
				<span>{isEn ? 'Contact Us' : 'Contattaci'}</span>
			</a>
		</Fragment>
	</CTASection>
</PageLayout>
